@startuml
title VPC-D08 Connector Error Normalization and Health Reporting Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Vendor interaction occurs;
if (Usable vendor result?) then (yes)
  :Normalize success or vendor business state;
else (no)
  if (Authentication or permission failure?) then (yes)
    :Normalize auth/permission failure;
  elseif (Timeout or unavailable?) then (yes)
    :Normalize timeout / unavailable;
  elseif (Mapping or data ambiguity?) then (yes)
    :Normalize ambiguous / insufficient;
  else
    :Normalize unknown / unexpected response;
  endif
endif
:Report normalized state to Central PMS;
:Expose health to Operator Console and Management Dashboard where authorized;
:Record audit and reconciliation context;
stop

note right
Normalization supports operations.
It does not decide payment, fiscal, tariff, discount, or exit authority.
end note
@enduml
